; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR MANDELBROT x 4  -  four VMs, one quarter each   (4 programs, 1 file)
; ==========================================================================
; Load this ONE file - VM1 $4000, VM2 $5000, VM3 $6000, VM4 $7000 - and
; cold-boot. The 40 x 24 Mandelbrot is drawn by all four VMs at once, each its
; own quarter (VM1 top-left, VM2 top-right, VM3 bottom-left, VM4 bottom-right).
; One 1802 is shared, so it is not faster than one VM - it shows the scheduler.
; Each pixel is one PRINTSTR, so the four never garble each other's output.
; Rerunnable without reloading.
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 (Craig).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/mandel4_verify.py, V0061.33, four-VM cold boot): the finished 40 x 24 picture is exactly the single-VM Mandelbrot's (itself byte for byte the July v08's); every pixel drawn exactly once, by the VM that owns its quarter; all four quarters start within the first 14 pixels drawn and grow together; no garbled output; all four 'done' marks and 'All four done.' once, last, cursor restored; no VM errors; a rerun without reloading draws the same. About 66 million 1802 instructions (~6.5 min at 3 MHz) + 9 KB of output.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; VM1: 177   VM2: 176   VM3: 176   VM4: 176 STELLAR commands.

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  VM1 ($4000), the top-left quarter  -  commented out
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0E 06 4B    LOADXI R14 064B
; D 4005 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Clear the screen, hide the cursor, the side panel
; D 4007 D0 11          SHAREVM on, read-only              The GO signal: VM2-4 wait for it
; D 4009 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000
; D 400D 11 0A 0A 00    LOADXI R10 0A00
; D 4011 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               row = our first row
; D 4014 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000
; D 4018 11 0A 0A 04    LOADXI R10 0A04
; D 401C 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               pixels drawn = 0
; ROW:
; D 401F 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000
; D 4023 11 0A 0A 02    LOADXI R10 0A02
; D 4027 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               col = our first column
; COL:
; D 402A 11 0A 0A 02    LOADXI R10 0A02
; D 402E 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 4031 10 00 16       LOADAI 0016
; D 4034 49 09          MULTXA R9                          col x 22
; D 4036 25             COPYMAA
; D 4037 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4039 11 0A 02 80    LOADXI R10 0280
; D 403D 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 403F A1 00 4C       IFFALSEI XN
; D 4042 51 9A 05       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R5
; D 4045 11 06 00 00    LOADXI R6 0000
; D 4049 B0 00 53       GAL XD
; XN:
; D 404C 51 A9 05       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R5              x0 < 0: |x0| = 2.5 - col x step
; D 404F 11 06 00 01    LOADXI R6 0001
; XD:
; D 4053 11 0A 0A 00    LOADXI R10 0A00
; D 4057 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 405A 10 00 1A       LOADAI 001A
; D 405D 49 09          MULTXA R9                          row x 26
; D 405F 25             COPYMAA
; D 4060 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4062 11 0A 01 33    LOADXI R10 0133
; D 4066 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 4068 A1 00 75       IFFALSEI YN
; D 406B 51 9A 07       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R7
; D 406E 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 4072 B0 00 7C       GAL YD
; YN:
; D 4075 51 A9 07       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R7
; D 4078 11 08 00 01    LOADXI R8 0001
; YD:
; D 407C 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 4080 11 02 00 00    LOADXI R2 0000
; D 4084 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; D 4088 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000
; D 408C 11 0D 00 00    LOADXI R13 0000                    z = 0, no iterations yet
; D 4090 11 0E 04 00    LOADXI R14 0400                    4.0
; IT:
; D 4094 4A 11          MULTXY R1 * R1                     xx = x*x >> 8
; D 4096 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 4098 21 19          COPYAX MA -> R9
; D 409A 4A 33          MULTXY R3 * R3                     yy = y*y >> 8
; D 409C 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 409E 21 1A          COPYAX MA -> R10
; D 40A0 50 9A 0B       ADDXYZ R9 + R10 -> R11
; D 40A3 88 BE          TESTGXY R11 >= R14
; D 40A5 A0 01 21       IFTRUEI ESC                        xx + yy >= 4: escaped
; D 40A8 4A 13          MULTXY R1 * R3                     x*y >> 8
; D 40AA 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 40AC 21 1B          COPYAX MA -> R11
; D 40AE 50 BB 0B       ADDXYZ R11 + R11 -> R11            2xy
; D 40B1 11 0C 00 00    LOADXI R12 0000
; D 40B5 87 24          TESTXY R2 = R4
; D 40B7 A0 00 BE       IFTRUEI SS
; D 40BA 11 0C 00 01    LOADXI R12 0001                    signs differ: 2xy < 0
; SS:
; D 40BE 11 0F 00 00    LOADXI R15 0000
; D 40C2 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 40C4 A0 00 D1       IFTRUEI TP                         xx - yy, as sign-magnitude
; D 40C7 51 A9 09       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R9
; D 40CA 11 0F 00 01    LOADXI R15 0001
; D 40CE B0 00 D4       GAL TD
; TP:
; D 40D1 51 9A 09       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R9
; TD:
; D 40D4 87 F6          TESTXY R15 = R6
; D 40D6 A1 00 E2       IFFALSEI SDX
; D 40D9 50 95 01       ADDXYZ R9 + R5 -> R1               same sign: add
; D 40DC 23 00 F2       COPYXY R15 -> R2
; D 40DF B0 00 F6       GAL SEX
; SDX:
; D 40E2 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 40E4 A1 00 F0       IFFALSEI SBX
; D 40E7 51 95 01       SUBXYZ R9 - R5 -> R1               signs differ, |a| >= |b|: a - b, sign of a
; D 40EA 23 00 F2       COPYXY R15 -> R2
; D 40ED B0 00 F6       GAL SEX
; SBX:
; D 40F0 51 59 01       SUBXYZ R5 - R9 -> R1               |b| > |a|: b - a, sign of b
; D 40F3 23 00 62       COPYXY R6 -> R2
; SEX:
; D 40F6 87 C8          TESTXY R12 = R8
; D 40F8 A1 01 04       IFFALSEI SDY
; D 40FB 50 B7 03       ADDXYZ R11 + R7 -> R3              same sign: add
; D 40FE 23 00 C4       COPYXY R12 -> R4
; D 4101 B0 01 18       GAL SEY
; SDY:
; D 4104 88 B7          TESTGXY R11 >= R7
; D 4106 A1 01 12       IFFALSEI SBY
; D 4109 51 B7 03       SUBXYZ R11 - R7 -> R3              signs differ, |a| >= |b|: a - b, sign of a
; D 410C 23 00 C4       COPYXY R12 -> R4
; D 410F B0 01 18       GAL SEY
; SBY:
; D 4112 51 7B 03       SUBXYZ R7 - R11 -> R3              |b| > |a|: b - a, sign of b
; D 4115 23 00 84       COPYXY R8 -> R4
